WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Tags. Coloured labels that cut across projects, added in the drawer or with @tag.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: context lists; escalations.

3
00:00:10.180 --> 00:00:13.360
Type a new tag and press Enter — it's created and added.

4
00:00:13.360 --> 00:00:16.130
Filter the list by tag.

5
00:00:16.130 --> 00:00:20.300
Rename, recolour or delete tags in Workspace settings.

6
00:00:20.300 --> 00:00:26.300
A tag disappeared from tasks: Someone deleted it in Workspace settings → Tags; deleting removes it everywhere.

7
00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:30.800
Create tags inline
